    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d620">

                <pb facs="0840" n="738" xml:id="pg738"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/858: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Kirk</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-08-17T21:00:00+01:00">August 17, 1935—9
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 17—5:06 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>494. Department’s 135, August 17, 2 p.m. Request for audience presented and I
                    expect a reply tomorrow morning.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kirk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
